<title>LITHUANIA: MAZHEIKIU NAFTA 5-MO PROFIT 2.97 MLN LITAS.</title>
<headline>MAZHEIKIU NAFTA 5-MO PROFIT 2.97 MLN LITAS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian oil refinery Mazheikiu Nafta said on Friday that its profit in the first five months of the year rose to 2.97 million litas from a loss of 51 million litas in the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>The company also said in a statement that its profit in May was 13.75 million litas verus 5.7 million litas profit in May 1996.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
